## Troubleshooting

| Issue | Fix |
|---|---|
| `Missing Bearer token` | User not signed in via Clerk |
| `Failed to look up meals` | Meal IDs in cart don't match DB — check `meals` table |
| `Plan "X" has no price set` | Run the migration SQL to add prices to `subscription_plans` |
| Payment succeeds but `payment_status` stays `pending` | Webhook not configured — check Step 6c/6d |
| `Invalid signature` in webhook logs | `STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET` doesn't match — re-copy from Stripe Dashboard |
| Payment Sheet doesn't open | Rebuild native app: `npx expo run:android` |

## Going Live

When ready for production:

1. Toggle Stripe Dashboard out of **Test mode**
2. Get live keys (`pk_live_...`, `sk_live_...`)
3. Update secrets: `supabase secrets set STRIPE_SECRET_KEY=sk_live_...`
4. Update `.env`: `EXPO_PUBLIC_STRIPE_PUBLISHABLE_KEY=pk_live_...`
5. Create a new live webhook endpoint with the production URL
6. Update: `supabase secrets set STRIPE_WEBHOOK_SECRET=whsec_...(live)`
7. Rebuild and submit to app stores
